href=http://pub5.ezboard.com/feqlinksfrm45.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=2.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   <BR><img src=http://www.iusb.edu/~dafinch/corna.jpg WIDTH=60 HEIGHT=60></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: AC &amp; Str ?</span><hr size=1> I'd say it depends on how you're playin for that particular night.<br><br>If you're pulling melee types, go with AC and HP gear.  (Every 3 agi gives one ac.  Every one raw ac gives 1.5 ac)<br><br>If you're pulling casters, use resists.<br><br>If you're purely doing damage, go with Str and Dex (if you have a proccing weapon.)<br><br>In the high level game, resists seem to be the key.  I've sacrificed weight, ac, str, and hps for resist gear.  <br> <p><img src="http://putrescence.org/symphony/cornasig.jpg"></p><i></i></td></tr></table><table border=0 width=95%><tr><td align=left valign="top"> </td><td align=right valign="top"><br><br><a href=http://pub5.ezboard.com/feqlinksfrm45.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=2.topic&index=1><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/addReply1.gif border=0 alt="Add Reply"></a> </td></tr></table><br><table width=95% border=0><td valign="top"> <a href=http://pub5.ezboard.com/feqlinksfrm45.emailToFriend?topicID=2.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/image/email.gif border=0 alt="Email This To a Friend"> Email This To a Friend</a><br> <a href=http://pub5.ezboard.com/feqlinksfrm45.threadControl?topicID=2.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/deleteThreadFire.gif border=0 alt="Topic Control Image"> Topic Commands (Moderator only)</a><br> <a href=http://pub5.ezboard.com/feqlinksfrm45.subscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=2.topic>Subscribe</a> Click to receive email notification of replies<br>  <a href=http://pub5.ezboard.com/feqlinksfrm45.unsubscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=2.topic>Unsubscribe</a> Click to stop receiving email notification of replies<br> </td><td align="right" valign="top"><